## AccountApi

### Unlink a third-party OAuth/social provider (Google, GitHub, etc.) from the account
## Unlink a third-party OAuth/social provider (Google, GitHub, etc.) from the account
DELETE https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/oauth/{{name}}
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Disable two-factor authentication and remove the TOTP secret
## Disable two-factor authentication and remove the TOTP secret
DELETE https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/2fa
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Remove one IP range from the account allow-list (PATCH on /account/iplimits)
## Remove one IP range from the account allow-list (PATCH on /account/iplimits)
PATCH https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/iplimits
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

{
 "start": "<string>",
 "end": "<string>"
}


### Read full account profile, billing address, and security settings
## Read full account profile, billing address, and security settings
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Fetch TOTP secret to enroll a 2FA authenticator app (Google Authenticator etc.)
## Fetch TOTP secret to enroll a 2FA authenticator app (Google Authenticator etc.)
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/2fa
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

