### Destroy the current API/web session — token becomes unusable
## Destroy the current API/web session — token becomes unusable
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/logout
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Sign out of the upstream OAuth provider session (does not unlink the account)
## Sign out of the upstream OAuth provider session (does not unlink the account)
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/oauth/{{name}}/logout
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Rotate the account&#39;s REST/MCP API key — old key is invalidated immediately
## Rotate the account&#39;s REST/MCP API key — old key is invalidated immediately
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/apikey
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Toggle account-wide safety locks for password reset and OS reinstall
## Toggle account-wide safety locks for password reset and OS reinstall
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/features
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Update contact and billing-address fields on the customer profile
## Update contact and billing-address fields on the customer profile
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Add an IP CIDR/range to the account&#39;s API+web allow-list (lockout-safe)
## Add an IP CIDR/range to the account&#39;s API+web allow-list (lockout-safe)
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/iplimits
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Change the account login password (verifies current, kills other sessions)
## Change the account login password (verifies current, kills other sessions)
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/password
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Set the account-level SSH public key auto-installed on new VPS/dedicated orders
## Set the account-level SSH public key auto-installed on new VPS/dedicated orders
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/sshkey
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Verify TOTP code and enable two-factor authentication on the account
## Verify TOTP code and enable two-factor authentication on the account
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/account/2fa
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}
